This could cut ~60px, making 590 height fit 640. Let's add a `@media (max-width:620px)` compact help. Current small card 650. Needed <600. Reduce:
padding 34+32=66 -> 20+18=38 saves 28
h2 31->24 saves 8, margin 20->12 saves 8
grid rows: each div padding 11*2=22 -> 8*2=16 (x3 rows, saves 18), gap 12 vertical ->8 (x2 saves 8)
touch help margin 12->8, padding 9->7 saves 6
