But note the media max-height 560 block occurs later? It's earlier in file (after pause actions) before responsive media. The max-height block is before `@media (max-width:900)` etc. If we add max-width 620 after max-height 560, it will override some landscape rules (landscape 844 width not). For 360x640 portrait, fine. For landscape width 844 not. Good.

